1 — Sea (0.0002 m)
2 — Smooth (0.005 m)
3 — Open (0.03 m)
4 — Roughly open (0.1 m)
5 — Rough (0.25 m)
6 — Very rough (0.5 m)
7 — Skimming (1 m)
8 — Chaotic (2 m)</item>
