            <chunk name="Object" index="79"><items count="3"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">5965fd10-b631-44e9-b55b-68a930d10df8</item><item name="Lib" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">82b21a65-da8f-433c-93fb-f9814609e1d6</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Velocity Amplification Factors (VAF)</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="4"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Compute Velocity Amplification Factors (VAF) and annual wind speed at probes from CFD or ML wind-prediction results and EPW weather data. VAF (the term used in the wind-engineering literature for what Eddy3D historically called &quot;wind factors&quot;) is the local wind speed normalized by the reference speed.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c7a41f0e-2b9d-4e83-a1c5-6f2e8d904b17</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Velocity Amplification Factors (VAF)</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">VAF</item></items><chunks count="9"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4313</X><Y>2748</Y><W>181</W><H>124</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4420</X><Y>2810</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="param_input" index="0"><items count="7"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">OutdoorBoundaryConditions object from the ABL or Uniform Flow component.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">d81c2a5f-4e07-49b6-8c3d-92a5e1f60b28</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Boundary Conditions</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">BC</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Source" index="0" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">08ba8b32-eaa5-42f3-aa84-f0d60573ba13</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4315</X><Y>2750</Y><W>90</W><H>20</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4361.5</X><Y>2760</Y></item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="param_input" index="1"><items count="7"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">DataTree {direction}[probe] of velocity vectors from the CFD probe results, OR of scalar wind speeds (m/s) from the Wind Predictor's Values output - either engine feeds the same annual wind field.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">e92d3b60-5f18-4ac7-9d4e-a3b6f2075c39</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Velocity</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">U</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Source" index="0" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a7baf374-d47d-4af9-9ef8-86b3fcbb29a7</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4315</X><Y>2770</Y><W>90</W><H>20</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4361.5</X><Y>2780</Y></item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="param_input" index="2"><items count="7"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Path to the EPW weather file.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fa3e4c71-6029-4bd8-ae5f-b4c703186d40</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">EPW</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">EPW</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="Source" index="0" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">4