            <chunk name="Object" index="80"><items count="3"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a7b3d4e5-8f91-4c62-bd73-5e6f7a8b9c01</item><item name="Lib" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a3f7d2c4-9b18-4e56-8a2f-1d6c0b9e4f30</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">UTCI (Simulation)</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="4"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Compute annual probe-specific UTCI from simulation outputs: MRT and wind-speed data trees, plus air temperature and relative humidity. For a weather-only calculator, use &quot;UTCI (Weather)&quot;.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">50a492d7-c68f-413e-84b5-1a2d697423a6</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">UTCI (Simulation)</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">UTCIsim</item></items><chunks count="10"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4673</X><Y>2748</Y><W>181</W><H>124</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4780</X><Y>2810</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="param_input" index="0"><items count="7"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The MRT component's Result (preferred), or a DataTree of annual MRT values - {probe}(8760) or {hour}(probes), both accepted.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">61b5a3e8-d790-424f-95c6-2b3e7a8534b7</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">MRT</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">M</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Source" index="0" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9681808c-a4e4-4fb3-9328-226bb9b94b85</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count