></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Item" index="0"><items count="1"><item name="boolean" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="param_output" index="0"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">UTCI data tree. Default: {hour}(probes). With Transpose off: {probe}(hours).</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c71b094e-3df6-48a5-fb2c-8194d0eb9a1d</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">UTCI</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">U</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4813</X><Y>2750</Y><W>39</W><H>40</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4832.5</X><Y>2770.0</Y></item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="param_output" index="1"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">No-thermal-stress hours per probe.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">d82c1a5f-4e07-49b6-0c3d-92a5e1fcab2e</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Comfort Hours</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">H</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4813</X><Y>2790</Y><W>39</W><H>40</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4832.5</X><Y>2810.0</Y></item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="param_output" index="2"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Comfort percentage per probe.</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">e93d2b60-5f18-4ac7-1d4e-a3b6f20dbc3f</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Comfort %</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">%</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="2"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4813</X><Y>2830</Y><W>39</W><H>40</H></item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4832.5</X><Y>2850.0</Y></item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="81"><items count="2"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="8"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f04e3c71-6029-4bd8-2e5f-b4c7031ecd40</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ANNUAL UTCI (all 8760 hours)

The hourly workflow on the left picks ONE hour. This section merges the ML wind prediction with the MRT simulation for the WHOLE year: the VAF component turns the Wind Predictor's per-direction speeds into an annual wind field using the EPW, and UTCI (Simulation) combines it with the MRT Result + air temperature + relative humidity.

The wind grid and the MRT sensors need not match: UTCI resamples the wind onto the sensors by nearest neighbor when the counts differ.

Run order: 1) ML Model + Wind Predictor, 2) MRT View Factors + MRT Solve, 3) click Run on UTCI (Simulation).</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="5"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>4280</X><Y>2470</Y><W>640</W><H>210</H></item><item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>4280</X><Y>2470</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="PanelProperties"><items count="7"><item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36"><ARGB>255;255;250;90</ARGB></item><item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk>
